'''The Pilot's Lounge''' was a destination for [[pilot]]s in [[the galaxy]]. During the [[Clone Wars]], the lounge featured a live [[band]] every [[Standard day|night]] and advertised at a [[Bith]]-owned [[fuel]]ing station on the [[planet]] [[Orondia]].<ref name="FAE" /> Several [[Standard year|years]] later, during the [[Imperial Era|reign]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], The Pilot's Lounge was advertised at [[Havoc Outpost]], a shipping site,<ref name="BS" /> and [[Horizon Base]], an Imperial outpost.<ref name="TFD" /> During the [[First Order-Resistance War]] decades later, an advertisement for the company was seen on the exterior of [[Vranki's Hotel and Casino]], a [[space station]] in the [[Voxx Cluster]].<ref name="Voxx">{{Resistance|The Voxx Vortex 5000}}</ref> Advertisements for The Pilot's Lounge were written in [[Aurebesh]] and featured illustrations of two Bith [[musician]]s and beverages.<ref name="TFD" />

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|Signage at the fueling station includes: Eat at Koe's, Bounty Emporium: Always Open, Bounty Never Sleeps; Security Services; Speeder Sales; The Pilot's Lounge (Live Band Every Night); Craft Repair and Maintenance; Repair Rack Droid Services; Orondia Tours; and Meteor Cafe.|StarWars.com "Friends and Enemies" Episode Guide|<ref name="Trivia" />}}
The Pilot's Lounge was first mentioned in "[[Friends and Enemies]]," the sixteenth episode in the [[The Clone Wars: Season Four|fourth season]] of the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' television series.<ref name="Friends and Enemies Episode Guide">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/friends-and-enemies-episode-guide|text="Friends and Enemies" Episode Guide &#124; The Clone Wars}}</ref> The episode aired on [[January 27]], [[2012]],<ref name="Episode Guide">''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars: Episode Guide]]''</ref> and depicted an advertisement for The Pilot's Lounge, along with signs for [[Koe's]], [[Bounty Emporium]], [[Orondia Tours]], and [[Meteor Cafe]], among others.<ref name="Trivia" /> These advertisements also briefly appeared in "[[Blood Sisters]]" and "[[The Forgotten Droid]],"<ref name="BS" /><ref name="Recon">{{RebelsRecon|VM4PSIlIrl4|#2.17: Inside "Shroud of Darkness" &#124; Star Wars Rebels|sw_url=video/rebels-recon-inside-shroud-of-darkness}}</ref> episodes from the [[Star Wars Rebels Season Two|second season]] of the animated series ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''.<ref name="Blood Sisters Episode Guide">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels/blood-sisters-episode-guide|text="Blood Sisters" Episode Guide &#124; Star Wars Rebels}}</ref><ref name="Forgotten Droid Episode Guide">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels/the-forgotten-droid-episode-guide|text="The Forgotten Droid" Episode Guide &#124; Star Wars Rebels}}</ref>

